graph TD
    ClientWeb[Web Application - Next.js]
    ClientMobile[Mobile App - Expo]
    
    subgraph Infrastructure
        Nginx[Nginx Reverse Proxy]
        API[NestJS API Server]
        
        subgraph Data Layer
            DB[(PostgreSQL)]
            Cache[(Redis)]
            Storage[(MinIO S3)]
        end
        
        subgraph Observability
            Prom[Prometheus]
            Graf[Grafana]
        end
    end
    
    ClientWeb -->|HTTPS / API Calls| Nginx
    ClientMobile -->|HTTPS / API Calls| Nginx
    
    Nginx -->|/api/v1/*| API
    Nginx -->|/*| ClientWeb
    
    API -->|Prisma| DB
    API -->|TCP| Cache
    API -->|AWS SDK| Storage
    
    Prom -->|Scrape /metrics| API
    Graf -->|Query| Prom
